comment0.text=\r\n\ This\ class\ represents\ graphical\ items\ (bars\ with\ rounded\ corners)\ to\ be\r\n\ sorted\ as\ used\ by\ SortPanel.\r\n\ \r\n\ @author\ Franz-Josef\r\n
