comment4.text=\r\n\ Draws\ an\ item\ with\ height\ and\ width\ specified\ as\ in\ prepareDraw.\r\n\ @param\ g\t\tThe\ graphics\ context\ to\ be\ used\r\n\ @param\ x\t\tThe\ left\ position\ of\ the\ item\r\n\ @param\ y\t\tThe\ bottom\ position\ of\ the\ item\r\n
